    "insert": "Summary: This project proposed an examination of the impact of generative AI in healthcare, for planning personalised treatment and mitigating potential errors.\n\nStrengths:\nThe motivation part is particularly good. Especially the hook and the anchor attract my interest to read. The causal link between the healthcare dilemma and the risk of AI integration is well presented."
