    "insert": "The research questions also cover a lot of different aspects of this big picture, i.e. risks (feasibility issue) and benefits (better treatment planning/diagnosis) of how AI-driven systems should be integrated. Although RQ1 is rather general and broad, the sub-RQs go into the details very well."
