    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The methodology is the core of an AI project, it's about what will be done in the experiments, what is expected in the results and what measures should be taken to ensure that one is able to solve problems and potential challenges. Even if it's only a proposal for a research project, the author needs to have a solid understanding of the techniques that will be used in the projects, and a concrete and feasible outline of the experiments. However, I do not find this information in the expose and this needs to be greatly improved by proposing a detailed experimental plan to address RQ3 (how to better integrate generative AI into healthcare systems)."
